rules_swift's worker runs every Swift tool through /usr/bin/xcrun on Apple
hosts. The Xcode toolchain needs that: it names the driver bare ("swiftc").
A hermetic toolchain (swift_tools) passes an execroot-relative path instead,
and xcrun would make it need a developer directory, so it fails with Xcode
hidden (P0-02, ci/no_xcode.sh). Skip xcrun for such paths.


